<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A Senior Fellow appointed under subsection (4) shall be entitled to be addressed as an Academician and be paid a special allowance for life by the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
