<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The first Fellows of the Academy shall comprise fifty Foundation Fellows appointed by the Minister from among eminent Malaysian citizens who are regarded by virtue of their respective achievements in the field of science, engineering or technology as being of exceptional merit and distinction."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
