<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal shall be kept in the custody of the President or such other person as may be authorised by the Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
