<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal shall not be affixed to any instrument except in the presence of the President and two other members of the Council who shall sign their names to the instrument in token of such presence, and the signatures shall be sufficient evidence that the seal was duly and properly affixed and is the lawful seal of the Academy."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
