<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~part_V__cl_18__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any document or instrument which, if executed by a person not being a body corporate, would not be required to be under seal, may in like manner be executed by the Council and such document or instrument may be executed on behalf of the Council by any officer or servant of the Academy generally or specially authorised by the Council in that behalf."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
