<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The President shall be the'chairman of the Council and shall preside at all meetings of the Council and the Academy at which he is present. (2) In the absence of the President, the Vice-President shall preside, and in the absence of the President and the Vice-President, the Council shall elect one of its members to preside."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
