<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_6__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Eight members personally present at any meeting of the Council shall constitute the quorum."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
