<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_6__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_6__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The chairman or member presiding at any meeting of the Council shall have an original and a casting vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
