<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subparagraph (2), the annual general meeting of the Academy shall be held in the first four months of each calendar year, and at such time as may be appointed by the Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
