<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The ordinary general meetings of the Academy shall be held at such place and at such time as may be appointed by the Council to discuss scientific, engineering or technological or other matters of concern to the members and shall be open to all Fellows and such other persons as the Council may determine. BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
