<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_8__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The procedure for the general meetings of the Academy and for service of notices shall be in accordance with the regulations as prescribed by the Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1__para_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/1/eng@> .
